        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A point-and-click adventure about memory and escape.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of point-and-click puzzle or escape-room games, and for explorers who enjoy pixel art, atmosphere, and environmental storytelling.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soul of Recollection is a pixel-style point-and-click adventure game. On a quiet yet unfamiliar night, you awaken in a classroom, stripped of all memories. Every locked door and scattered object hides a clue. You must solve puzzles and explore step by step to piece together the truth and find a way out of the school shrouded in darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, along the way, you encounter another trapped girl. She seems to know a lot, yet her memory is in disarray. Even stranger—after meeting her, the student ID card that once bore your photo suddenly shows her name and information...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who are you? Who is she? What secrets lie hidden within this school and these memories?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067350/extras/4082163a66ec2f1e5e020736be835297.avif?t=1763640007\" width=1560 height=421 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Point-and-Click Experience</strong><br>Interact with scenes through intuitive pointing and clicking. Collect items, solve puzzles, and push the story forward.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Art with a Mysterious Atmosphere</strong><br>All scenes are inspired by real-life schools and reconstructed with detailed pixel art. Beneath the nostalgic visuals, the nighttime campus exudes an eerie familiarity.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Rooms and Puzzle Designs</strong><br>From classrooms to halls, cafeterias to gyms, laboratories to auditoriums—each area introduces new mechanisms and challenges. Estimated full playtime: 4–8 hours.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual-Identity Mystery Story</strong><br>Crossing memories and shifting dual perspectives unravel the deeper truth behind the puzzles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Concise yet Profound Narrative</strong><br>With around 2,000 words of core text, the story delivers immersion through minimal prose, rich environments, and fragmented clues.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Suspense, Not Horror</strong><br>No jump scares or gore—focuses on mood, discovery, and puzzle flow.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built-in Hints and Solutions</strong><br>Every puzzle includes optional hints and answers. No need to fear getting stuck—enjoy the story seamlessly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067350/extras/2d8e65ba816060b5d9f070ebb2f063bf.avif?t=1763640007\" width=1560 height=223 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feedback</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dear player,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’m Orange, the solo developer of this game. It took two years from concept to completion, and I’m truly happy to finally share it with you on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter any <strong>bugs, crashes, or other issues</strong>, please report them via Steam support with a short description of the <strong>problem and the scene or steps where it occurred</strong>. This helps me locate and fix it faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’ll do my best to resolve issues as soon as possible. Thank you so much for your patience and support!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A point-and-click adventure about memory and escape.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of point-and-click puzzle or escape-room games, and for explorers who enjoy pixel art, atmosphere, and environmental storytelling.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soul of Recollection is a pixel-style point-and-click adventure game. On a quiet yet unfamiliar night, you awaken in a classroom, stripped of all memories. Every locked door and scattered object hides a clue. You must solve puzzles and explore step by step to piece together the truth and find a way out of the school shrouded in darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, along the way, you encounter another trapped girl. She seems to know a lot, yet her memory is in disarray. Even stranger—after meeting her, the student ID card that once bore your photo suddenly shows her name and information...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who are you? Who is she? What secrets lie hidden within this school and these memories?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067350/extras/4082163a66ec2f1e5e020736be835297.avif?t=1763640007\" width=1560 height=421 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Point-and-Click Experience</strong><br>Interact with scenes through intuitive pointing and clicking. Collect items, solve puzzles, and push the story forward.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Art with a Mysterious Atmosphere</strong><br>All scenes are inspired by real-life schools and reconstructed with detailed pixel art. Beneath the nostalgic visuals, the nighttime campus exudes an eerie familiarity.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Rooms and Puzzle Designs</strong><br>From classrooms to halls, cafeterias to gyms, laboratories to auditoriums—each area introduces new mechanisms and challenges. Estimated full playtime: 4–8 hours.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual-Identity Mystery Story</strong><br>Crossing memories and shifting dual perspectives unravel the deeper truth behind the puzzles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Concise yet Profound Narrative</strong><br>With around 2,000 words of core text, the story delivers immersion through minimal prose, rich environments, and fragmented clues.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Suspense, Not Horror</strong><br>No jump scares or gore—focuses on mood, discovery, and puzzle flow.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built-in Hints and Solutions</strong><br>Every puzzle includes optional hints and answers. No need to fear getting stuck—enjoy the story seamlessly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067350/extras/2d8e65ba816060b5d9f070ebb2f063bf.avif?t=1763640007\" width=1560 height=223 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feedback</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dear player,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’m Orange, the solo developer of this game. It took two years from concept to completion, and I’m truly happy to finally share it with you on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter any <strong>bugs, crashes, or other issues</strong>, please report them via Steam support with a short description of the <strong>problem and the scene or steps where it occurred</strong>. This helps me locate and fix it faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’ll do my best to resolve issues as soon as possible. Thank you so much for your patience and support!</p>",
        "short_description": "Soul of Recollection is a pixel-style point-and-click puzzle game. Explore a quiet school at night, collect items, solve puzzles, and piece together lost memories to find your way out. With no horror elements, it blends light storytelling and immersive mystery.",
